# Minime preloaded-ROM folder mapping (single source of truth).
#
# Format: short_name|minui_name|allium_name
#
# Consumed at build time by roms/install.sh (per-UI preloaded-ROM staging) and
# at runtime by /usr/bin/update.sh (renames Roms/ subfolders when switching
# UIs).  Both use the same table so the two naming conventions never diverge.

gb|Game Boy (GB)|GB
gbc|Game Boy Color (GBC)|GBC
gba|Game Boy Advance (GBA)|GBA
nes|Nintendo Entertainment System (FC)|FC
snes|Super Nintendo (SFC)|SFC
md|Sega Genesis (MD)|MD
gg|Game Gear (GG)|GG
sms|Master System (SMS)|MS
psx|Sony PlayStation (PS)|PS
pce|PC Engine (PCE)|PCE
saturn|Sega Saturn (SAT)|SAT
lynx|Atari Lynx (LYNX)|LYNX
ngp|Neo Geo Pocket (NGP)|NGP
wswan|WonderSwan (WS)|WS
